ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nOn a cold winter night, Xiao Li is reading a book about plant encyclopedia at home. Her friend Xiao Wang calls her, tells her that he meets a botanist in a nearby cafe, and invites her to come over. Xiao Li hesitates for a while, because she remembers that there is an important biology exam tomorrow. She looks at the snow scene outside the window, then turns back to look at the notes and books piled up on the desk. Her cat jumps on the table and looks at her curiously.\n\n[Question]\nWhat does Xiao Li do after receiving Xiao Wang's call?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. She continues to stay at home and read.\nB. She reviews the questions she gets wrong before.\nC. She goes out to the cafe to meet the botanist.\nD. She plays with her cat to relieve the pressure of studying.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.003172571354112342,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e088d6006945d27fc43b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367624461,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:27:04","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"46be02a67dff489a93ad9a5109119276"}